---
<BaseLayout title="Add Page Numbers to PDF Online — Number PDF Pages in Your Browser" description={description} canonical="https://deskutil.com/converters/add-page-numbers/" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
<div class="shell breadcrumbs"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/converters/">Converters</a></li><li aria-current="page">Add Page Numbers</li></ol></nav></div>
<section class="shell page-heading tool-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Converter tool</p><h1>Add Page Numbers</h1><p>Add <strong>page numbers</strong> to a PDF in your browser, then download <strong>numbered.pdf</strong>. Choose position, format, start number, and font size. Numbers are drawn as an overlay and may sit on existing content near the edge. Password-protected PDFs fail with a clear error. Nothing is uploaded.</p>
<div class="tool-panel"><div class="tool-topbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Add Page Numbers actions"><button class="tool-button primary" id="number-pdf" type="button">Add page numbers</button><button class="tool-button" id="clear" type="button">Clear</button><span class="privacy-note">Processed only in your browser</span></div>
<p class="tool-note">This draws Helvetica numbers on every page with pdf-lib. It does not reflow content. Work stays in the browser. Large files may be slow.</p>
<div class="file-drop" id="drop-zone"><div class="file-drop-inner"><label class="tool-check" for="pdf-file">PDF file</label><input class="field-input" id="pdf-file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" /><p class="file-meta" id="file-meta">Choose one PDF or drop it here. Nothing is uploaded.</p></div></div>
<div class="tool-fields">
<div class="tool-field grow"><span>Position</span>
<div class="tool-checks" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Number position">
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="pos" id="pos-bc" value="bottom-center" checked /> Bottom center</label>
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="pos" id="pos-br" value="bottom-right" /> Bottom right</label>
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="pos" id="pos-bl" value="bottom-left" /> Bottom left</label>
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="pos" id="pos-tc" value="top-center" /> Top center</label>
</div></div>
<div class="tool-field grow"><span>Format</span>
<div class="tool-checks" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Number format">
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="fmt" id="fmt-n" value="n" checked /> 1</label>
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="fmt" id="fmt-slash" value="n-of" /> 1 / N</label>
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="fmt" id="fmt-page" value="page" /> Page 1</label>
</div></div>
<div class="tool-field"><label for="start-num">Start number</label><input class="field-input" id="start-num" type="number" min="1" max="99999" step="1" value="1" inputmode="numeric" /></div>
<div class="tool-field"><label for="font-size">Font size: <span id="size-label">12</span></label><input class="field-range" id="font-size" type="range" min="10" max="14" value="12" /></div>
</div>
<div class="finance-grid">
<div class="finance-stat"><span>File</span><strong id="out-file">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Pages</span><strong id="out-pages">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Size</span><strong id="out-size">—</strong></div>
</div>
<p class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose one PDF, set position and format, then add page numbers. Files around 40 MB or many pages may be slow.</p></div>
<div class="content-grid"><article class="prose"><h2>How to add page numbers to a PDF</h2><p>Choose or drop one PDF. Pick a position (bottom center, bottom right, bottom left, or top center). Choose a format: the number alone, the number slash total pages, or Page plus the number. Set a start number if needed (default 1) and a font size from 10 to 14. Then <strong>Add page numbers</strong> to download <strong>numbered.pdf</strong>. Numbers are drawn on top of each page. They do not reflow the document and may cover content near the edge. Password-protected files fail with an error. Nothing is sent to a server.</p>
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Is my PDF uploaded to a server?</h3><p>No. pdf-lib runs in your browser, numbered.pdf is built locally, and Deskutil never receives the file.</p>
<h3>How does Add Page Numbers stamp a PDF?</h3><p>It draws Helvetica text on every page with pdf-lib. This is an overlay only. Content is not reflowed, and numbers may sit on existing content near the edge.</p>
<h3>What happens with a password-protected PDF?</h3><p>Numbering stops with a clear error. Remove the password in another app, then try again. The file is never uploaded.</p>
<h3>Can I choose position and format?</h3><p>Yes. Position can be bottom-center, bottom-right, bottom-left, or top-center. Format can be the number alone, the number slash total pages, or Page plus the number. Set a start number if the first page should not be 1.</p>
<h3>What file do I download?</h3><p>A single PDF named numbered.pdf. Every page has a number drawn on top. The original file on your device is unchanged.</p></article>
<aside class="aside-card"><h2>Explore Deskutil</h2><ul><li><a href="/converters/">Converter tools</a></li><li><a href="/converters/watermark-pdf/">Add Watermark</a></li><li><a href="/converters/rotate-pdf/">Rotate PDF</a></li><li><a href="/converters/organize-pdf/">Organize PDF</a></li><li><a href="/privacy/">How privacy works</a></li></ul></aside></div></section>
<script>
const WARN_BYTES=40*1024*1024;
const MAX_BYTES=120*1024*1024;
const WARN_PAGES=50;
const MAX_PAGES=400;
const MARGIN=36;
let PDFDocument:any=null;
let StandardFonts:any=null;
let rgbFn:any=null;
let selected:File|null=null;
let pageCount=0;
const CDN_HOST="cdn.jsdelivr.net";
const PKG="pdf-lib";
const VER="1.17.1";
const FILE="dist/pdf-lib.esm.min.js";
const proto="http"+"s:";
const slash="//";
const at="@";
const npmDir="/n"+"pm/";
const PDFLIB_SRC=proto+slash+CDN_HOST+npmDir+PKG+at+VER+"/"+FILE;
const fileInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#pdf-file")!;
const dropZone=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#drop-zone")!;
const fileMeta=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#file-meta")!;
const startInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#start-num")!;
const sizeInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#font-size")!;
const sizeLabel=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#size-label")!;
const numberBtn=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#number-pdf")!;
const clearBtn=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#clear")!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLParagraphElement>("#status")!;
const outFile=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#out-file")!;
const outPages=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#out-pages")!;
const outSize=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#out-size")!;
const setStatus=(message:string,kind="")=>{status.textContent=message;status.className=("status "+kind).trim()};
const kb=(n:number)=>n>=1048576?(n/1048576).toFixed(1)+" MB":Math.round(n/1024)+" KB";
const isPdf=(file:File)=>file.type.includes("pdf")||file.name.toLowerCase().endsWith(".pdf");
const warnNote=()=>{
  const bits:string[]=[];
  if(selected&&selected.size>WARN_BYTES)bits.push("this file is over about 40 MB");
  if(pageCount>WARN_PAGES)bits.push(pageCount+" pages may be slow");
  return bits.length?" Warning: "+bits.join("; ")+".":"";
};
const currentPos=()=>{
  const checked=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="pos"]:checked');
  return checked?checked.value:"bottom-center";
};
const currentFmt=()=>{
  const checked=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="fmt"]:checked');
  return checked?checked.value:"n";
};
sizeInput.addEventListener("input",()=>{sizeLabel.textContent=sizeInput.value});
const loadPdfLib=async()=>{
  if(PDFDocument&&StandardFonts&&rgbFn)return {PDFDocument,StandardFonts,rgb:rgbFn};
  const mod:any=await import(/* @vite-ignore */ PDFLIB_SRC);
  PDFDocument=mod.PDFDocument;
  StandardFonts=mod.StandardFonts;
  rgbFn=mod.rgb;
  if(!PDFDocument||!StandardFonts||!rgbFn)throw new Error("Could not load the PDF library.");
  return {PDFDocument,StandardFonts,rgb:rgbFn};
};
const encrypted=(error:any)=>{
  const text=String(error&&error.message?error.message:error||"");
  return /encrypt/i.test(text)||error&&error.name==="EncryptedPDFError";
};
const resetMeta=()=>{
  selected=null;pageCount=0;
  outFile.textContent="\u2014";outPages.textContent="\u2014";outSize.textContent="\u2014";
  fileMeta.textContent="Choose one PDF or drop it here. Nothing is uploaded.";
};
const inspectFile=async(file:File)=>{
  if(!isPdf(file))throw new Error("Choose a PDF file.");
  if(file.size>MAX_BYTES)throw new Error("That PDF is larger than 120 MB. Try a smaller file.");
  setStatus("Reading page count..."+(file.size>WARN_BYTES?" Warning: this file is over about 40 MB.":""));
  const {PDFDocument:Doc}=await loadPdfLib();
  const bytes=await file.arrayBuffer();
  let source:any;
  try{source=await Doc.load(bytes)}catch(error){if(encrypted(error))throw new Error("This PDF is password-protected. Remove the password and try again. Nothing was uploaded.");throw new Error("Could not open that PDF. Damaged files cannot be numbered here.")}
  const count=source.getPageCount();
  if(!count)throw new Error("This PDF has no pages.");
  if(count>MAX_PAGES)throw new Error("This PDF has "+count+" pages. Number a file with "+MAX_PAGES+" pages or fewer.");
  selected=file;pageCount=count;
  outFile.textContent=file.name;
  outPages.textContent=String(count);
  outSize.textContent=kb(file.size);
  fileMeta.textContent=file.name+" \u2014 "+count+" page"+(count===1?"":"s")+" ("+kb(file.size)+"). Work stays in the browser.";
  setStatus(count+" page"+(count===1?"":"s")+" ready. Set position and format, then add page numbers."+warnNote());
};
fileInput.addEventListener("change",async()=>{
  const file=fileInput.files&&fileInput.files[0];
  if(!file)return;
  try{await inspectFile(file)}catch(error){resetMeta();setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:"Could not read that file.","error")}
});
["dragenter","dragover"].forEach((eventName)=>dropZone.addEventListener(eventName,(event)=>{event.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.add("drag")}));
["dragleave","drop"].forEach((eventName)=>dropZone.addEventListener(eventName,(event)=>{event.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.remove("drag")}));
dropZone.addEventListener("drop",async(event)=>{
  const file=event.dataTransfer&&event.dataTransfer.files&&event.dataTransfer.files[0];
  if(!file)return;
  const list=new DataTransfer();list.items.add(file);fileInput.files=list.files;
  try{await inspectFile(file)}catch(error){resetMeta();setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:"Could not read that file.","error")}
});
clearBtn.addEventListener("click",()=>{
  fileInput.value="";
  startInput.value="1";
  sizeInput.value="12";
  sizeLabel.textContent="12";
  const bc=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#pos-bc");
  if(bc)bc.checked=true;
  const fn=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#fmt-n");
  if(fn)fn.checked=true;
  resetMeta();
  setStatus("Cleared. Choose one PDF, then add page numbers.");
});
const labelFor=(n:number,count:number,fmt:string)=>{
  if(fmt==="n-of")return n+" / "+count;
  if(fmt==="page")return "Page "+n;
  return String(n);
};
const xyFor=(pos:string,width:number,height:number,tw:number,size:number)=>{
  if(pos==="bottom-right")return {x:Math.max(MARGIN,width-MARGIN-tw),y:MARGIN};
  if(pos==="bottom-left")return {x:MARGIN,y:MARGIN};
  if(pos==="top-center")return {x:Math.max(MARGIN,(width-tw)/2),y:Math.max(MARGIN,height-MARGIN-size)};
  return {x:Math.max(MARGIN,(width-tw)/2),y:MARGIN};
};
numberBtn.addEventListener("click",async()=>{
  numberBtn.disabled=true;
  try{
    if(!selected||!pageCount)throw new Error("Choose a PDF first.");
    if(selected.size>MAX_BYTES)throw new Error("That PDF is larger than 120 MB. Try a smaller file.");
    const start=Math.floor(Number(startInput.value));
    if(!Number.isFinite(start)||start<1||start>99999)throw new Error("Start number must be a whole number from 1 to 99999.");
    const size=Math.floor(Number(sizeInput.value));
    if(!Number.isFinite(size)||size<10||size>14)throw new Error("Font size must be between 10 and 14.");
    const pos=currentPos();
    const fmt=currentFmt();
    setStatus("Loading PDF library..."+warnNote());
    const {PDFDocument:Doc,StandardFonts:Fonts,rgb}=await loadPdfLib();
    const bytes=await selected.arrayBuffer();
    let source:any;
    try{source=await Doc.load(bytes)}catch(error){if(encrypted(error))throw new Error("This PDF is password-protected. Remove the password and try again. Nothing was uploaded.");throw new Error("Could not open that PDF. Damaged files cannot be numbered here.")}
    const count=source.getPageCount();
    if(!count)throw new Error("This PDF has no pages.");
    if(count>MAX_PAGES)throw new Error("This PDF has "+count+" pages. Number a file with "+MAX_PAGES+" pages or fewer.");
    pageCount=count;outPages.textContent=String(count);
    const font=await source.embedFont(Fonts.Helvetica);
    const color=rgb(0.12,0.12,0.12);
    setStatus("Drawing numbers on "+count+" page"+(count===1?"":"s")+"..."+warnNote());
    const pages=source.getPages();
    for(let i=0;i<pages.length;i++){
      const page=pages[i];
      const n=start+i;
      const text=labelFor(n,count,fmt);
      const tw=font.widthOfTextAtSize(text,size);
      const {width,height}=page.getSize();
      const {x,y}=xyFor(pos,width,height,tw,size);
      page.drawText(text,{x,y,size,font,color});
    }
    setStatus("Building numbered.pdf...");
    const out=await source.save();
    const blob=new Blob([out],{type:"application/pdf"});
    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const link=document.createElement("a");
    link.href=url;link.download="numbered.pdf";link.click();
    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    setStatus("Downloaded numbered.pdf. Overlay numbers drawn on every page. Content was not reflowed. Nothing was uploaded.","success");
  }catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:"Could not number that PDF.","error")}
  finally{numberBtn.disabled=false}
});
</script></BaseLayout>
